  - Id: start
    Speaker: {fileID: 0}
    DialogueText: Oh man, that was a bit deep, weren't it? I'm just trying to get
      something started here.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Where's Ralph and Sanjeet? Just tell me. I don't wanna have to
        do anything.
